{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23900","headline":"雪夜喜李郎中见访兼酬所赠 · 白居易","name":"雪夜喜李郎中见访兼酬所赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜今夜鹅毛雪，引得高情鹤氅人。\n红蜡烛前明似昼，青毡帐里暖如春。\n十分满醆黄金液，一尺中庭白玉尘。\n对此欲留君便宿，诗情酒分合相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}